# Shared module conventions

- `modules/shared/**` may be imported by any other module. It must
  never import from `modules/users/**` or `modules/profiles/**` -
  shared code has no knowledge of any single module's business logic.
- Keep exports generic (HTTP helpers, primitive types). Do not add a
  `User` or `Profile` type here - business types stay owned by their
  module.
